    </a>
            
                <p class="subtitle">
                    Gerber to PDF converter
                </p>
            
            </div>
            
            </div>

            <div class="description">
        
            Gerber2PDF is a command-line tool to convert Gerber files to PDF for proofing and hobbyist printing purposes.

It converts multiple Gerber files at once, placing the resulting layers each on it&#39;s own page within the PDF.  Each layer has a PDF bookmark for easy reference.

Layers can optionally be combined onto a single page and rendered with custom colours and transparency.

There is a Drill to Gerber converter available from the downloads page.
    </div>
